  description: 'If this card is in your hand: You can target 1 "Gimmick Puppet" monster
    in your GY or 1 monster in your opponent''s GY; Special Summon it to its owner''s
    field in Defense Position, but its effects are negated, then Special Summon this
    card. If this card is sent to the GY, except from the hand: You can add it to
    your hand. You can only use each effect of "Gimmick Puppet Fiendish Knight" once
    per turn, also you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck the turn you activate
    either of this card''s effects, except "Gimmick Puppet" monsters.'
